{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"card":1,"entry":2,"missions":29,"alongside":30,"kin":31,"engines":56,"usedOn":57,"sites":58,"crewed":59,"museums":60,"hero":61},"https://www.orrerylearn.com/images/cards/fleet/phobos-2.jpg",{"id":3,"name":4,"category":5,"agency":6,"country":7,"manufacturer":8,"first_flight":9,"status":10,"era":11,"epoch":12,"best_known_for":13,"credit":14,"links":15,"tagline":13,"description":28},"phobos-2","Phobos 2","orbiter","Roscosmos","USSR","NPO Lavochkin","1988-07-12","FAILED","1981-2011","shuttle-and-mir","苏联最后一次行星际任务；在火卫一接近时失联","Skeleton entry for /fleet (PRD-012 v0.2 / Phase A scaffold). Builder + agency + first-flight per public sources. Specs and gallery TBD in later phases.",[16,20,24],{"l":17,"u":18,"t":19},"Phobos 2 — Wikipedia","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phobos_2","intro",{"l":21,"u":22,"t":23},"Программа «Фобос» — Роскосмос","https://www.roscosmos.ru/24190/","core",{"l":25,"u":26,"t":27},"Phobos 2 — NASA NSSDCA","https://nssdc.gsfc.nasa.gov/nmc/spacecraft/display.action?id=1988-059A","deep","苏联最后一次行星际任务。1989 年 1 月进入火星轨道，但于 1989 年 3 月 27 日与地球失去联系，当时距它计划与火星卫星火卫一交会仅差一点时间。失联前，Phobos 2 已传回 37 张火卫一图像。失联被归因于星载计算机故障，导致姿态控制和电力丧失，但完整过程始终未能完全重建。",[],[],[32,36,40,44,48,52],{"id":33,"name":34,"tagline":35},"mars3-orbiter","Mars 3 Orbiter","苏联Mars 3伴随轨道器——绕火星运行于1971-12-02至1972-08；首次测量火星上层大气温度",{"id":37,"name":38,"tagline":39},"mars2-orbiter","Mars 2 Orbiter","苏联Mars 2伴随轨道器——第二个进入火星轨道的航天器（仅晚于Mariner 9 13天）。运行时间从1971-11-27至1972-08",{"id":41,"name":42,"tagline":43},"luna10","Luna 10","首个绕月球运行的航天器（或任何非地球天体的首颗人造卫星）——进入月球轨道时间为1966-04-03，比Apollo 8早三年",{"id":45,"name":46,"tagline":47},"galileo","Galileo","首个木星轨道器；开展了8年的测量",{"id":49,"name":50,"tagline":51},"magellan","Magellan","探测到98%的金星表面",{"id":53,"name":54,"tagline":55},"ulysses","Ulysses","首颗在黄道面之上和之下观测太阳两极的航天器——1992 年木星引力辅助",[],[],[],[],[],"/orrery/images/fleet-galleries/phobos-2/01.webp"],"uses":{"params":["id"]}}]}
